        {
          "support_span_id": "span_prop_mistel_silent_claim",
          "exact_quote": "▼ Mechanical keyboard with Cherry MX Silent Red Switches (Linear): Cherry MX patented noise reduction technology reliably minimizes any operating noises. With same operation force but slight shorter travel distance comparing with Cherry MX Red, Cherry MX Silent Red is the most silent form of quality, precision and reliability making it ideal for office environments and gaming team group.",
